 accredited with\n‘B’ Grade (CGPA 2.34) by NAAC\nin its 1st cycle of accreditation in the year 2021.\nNIRF\nNotifications\nJul 29\n2026\nRevised Academic Calendar-2026\nNew\nJul 18\n2026\nResult of the 4th Semester BA Examinations (FYUGP) held in June, 2026\nNew\nJul 17\n2026\nResult of the 2nd Semester BA Examinations (FYUGP) held in June, 2026\nNew\nJul 16\n2026\nResult of the 6th Semester BA Examinations (FYUGP) held in June, 2026\nNew\nJun 15\n2026\nResult of B.A. 6th Semester (CBCS) Examinations held in May, 2026\nNew\nView All\nPRINCIPAL'S MESSAGE\nIt is a matter of great honour to share that Moran Mahila Mahavidyalaya is the only higher education institution exclusively for women in Charaideo district, the historic capital of the glorious Ahom kingdom. To face the challenges and opportunities of the 21st century, our college remains committed to equipping our young women students with the skills they need to thrive in an ever-evolving world.\nOur Vision\nTo foster empowerment, independence and holistic development through quality education, nurturing confident, skilled and socially responsible women who contribute meaningfully to families, communities and the global society.\nOur Mission\nTo promote inclusive and equitable education that empowers women with intellectual curiosity, critical thinking and lifelong learning, while upholding cultural values and fostering social responsibility, leadership and global citizenship.\nAISHE Certificate\nSubjects (Degree Level)\nSubjects (Higher Secondary)\nAdd-on-Courses\nIQAC\nCommittees\nCells\nNSS\nCollege Magazine\nKKHSOU Study Centre\nProspectus\nNewsletters\nIDP\nAAA\nGender Audit\nFacilities\nMoran Mahila Mahavidyalaya provides a range of student-centric facilities, including a well-equipped library, indoor stadium, gymnasium, ICT-enabled classrooms, hygienic canteen, and secure accommodation in the college hostel. The college also offers a variety of Add-on Courses (Self-finance course) such as Beautician, Computer DTP, Yoga, Clothing Construction and Communicative English, along with specialized programs like the sixth Months Diploma in Computer Applications (DCA). These initiatives aim to enhance students' academic and personal growth, equipping them with practical skills for better employability and preparing them for success in the competitive job market.\nLibrary\nThe college has a library where all the records are computerized. The college library is well-equ...\nHostel\nThere is RCC hostel building in the college campus with all the essential facilities required for...\nCollege Canteen\nCanteen facility is available in the college campus where food is served such as snacks, sweets...\nU.G.C. Network Resource Centre\nU.G.C. Network Resource Centre was established in 2011. It is an information centre and it provides.\nGuest House\nMoran Mahila Mahavidyalaya offers a well-maintained guest- house facility designed to cater...\nICT ENABLED CLASSROOM\nMoran Mahila Mahavidyalaya in Assam integrates modern technology into its educational infrastructure\nGames and Sports Facilities\nMoran Mahila Mahavidyalaya places equal emphasis on academics and physical fitness,etc.\nHighlights\n32\nFaculty\n1300\nStudents\n15\nStaff\nNews & Events\nCelebration of World Tourism Day -2026\nGeography\nCelebration of NSS Day 2026\nQuiz Programme under Seva Sankalp Abhiyan\nTribute to Zubeen Garg\nUnlocking the Potential of Young Minds\nCampus View\nAwards & Achievement\nNAAC Accreditation \"B\" Grade 2021, 1st Cycle\nThe college has been accredited with ‘B’ Grade (CGPA 2.34) by NAAC in its 1st cycle of accreditation\nPhoto Gallery\nGlimpses of Our College\nGallery\nAll Staff\nActivity\nBook Publication Meeting\nNAAC Visit\nVIEW  ALL\nContact Address\nThakur Bari Road ,Opp. Moranhat Post Office, Jyotipur, Moranhat Town, Assam 785670\n+91 94015 36237\nprincipal@moranmahilamahavidyalaya.ac.in\nImportant Links\nRTI\nDARPAN Portal\nDepartment Login\nRefund/Cancellation policy\nPrivacy Policy\nTer